            <header class="lesson-header"><span class="lesson-number">Lesson 28</span><h1>Building a Complete Microservices System</h1><div class="lesson-meta"><span class="lesson-duration"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>45 min</span><span class="lesson-level advanced">Advanced</span></div></header>
            <div class="lesson-body">
                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>E-Commerce System Architecture</h2>
                    <pre><code class="language-text">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                              Clients                                     │
│                    (Web, Mobile, Third-Party)                           │
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                │
                    ┌───────────▼───────────┐
                    │     API Gateway       │
                    │       (YARP)          │
                    └───────────┬───────────┘
                                │
        ┌───────────────────────┼───────────────────────┐
        │                       │                       │
┌───────▼───────┐   ┌───────────▼───────────┐  ┌───────▼───────┐
│    Order      │   │      Inventory        │  │   Payment     │
│   Service     │   │       Service         │  │   Service     │
└───────┬───────┘   └───────────┬───────────┘  └───────┬───────┘
        │                       │                       │
        │           ┌───────────▼───────────┐          │
        └──────────►│      RabbitMQ         │◄─────────┘
                    │   (Message Broker)    │
                    └───────────────────────┘</code></pre>
                </section>

                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Services Overview</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>API Gateway (YARP):</strong> Routing, auth, rate limiting</li>
                        <li><strong>Order Service:</strong> Order management, saga orchestration</li>
                        <li><strong>Inventory Service:</strong> Stock management (gRPC)</li>
                        <li><strong>Payment Service:</strong> Payment processing</li>
                        <li><strong>Notification Service:</strong> Email/SMS (event-driven)</li>
                        <li><strong>Identity Service:</strong> Authentication (Duende IdentityServer)</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Order Flow (Saga)</h2>
                    <pre><code class="language-text">1. OrderSubmitted
   └─► ReserveInventory (gRPC)
       ├─► InventoryReserved
       │   └─► ProcessPayment
       │       ├─► PaymentSucceeded
       │       │   └─► CompleteOrder → SendNotification
       │       └─► PaymentFailed
       │           └─► ReleaseInventory (compensate)
       └─► InventoryInsufficient
           └─► RejectOrder</code></pre>
                </section>

                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Infrastructure Stack</h2>
                    <pre><code class="language-yaml"># docker-compose.yml
services:
  api-gateway:         # YARP
  order-service:       # .NET 8
  inventory-service:   # .NET 8 + gRPC
  payment-service:     # .NET 8
  notification-service: # .NET 8 Worker
  
  # Infrastructure
  rabbitmq:            # Messaging
  postgres:            # Databases
  redis:               # Caching
  seq:                 # Logging
  jaeger:              # Tracing
  prometheus:          # Metrics
  grafana:             # Dashboards</code></pre>
                </section>

                <section class="lesson-section">
                    <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
                    <div class="takeaways">
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Start with clear service boundaries (DDD).</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Use events for loose coupling between services.</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Implement observability from day one.</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Use sagas for distributed transactions.</span></div>
                    </div>
                </section>

